  biomeName: Tectonic Shards
  minDepthMeters: 4025
  maxDepthMeters: 4550
  shortDescription: Knife-thin vertical shards jutting from the floor.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Abyss biome. Come here for specialized runs, rarer materials, and
    read walls, fissures, and major vertical routes.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Copper Ore and Cobalt Alloy.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Iron Composite and Copper Wire.'
  landmarkIdentity: Tectonic Shards reads through walls, fins, fissures, and giant
    vertical breaks. Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are scarce. Relief should come from one clear
    nook, not constant cover.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: vertical trap geometry and hard commitment, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Targeted node work along long rock lines and exposed shelves.
    Mid-depth: work edges, cracks, and vertical seams, then return before greed stretches
    the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is main ridge line. This slot should read through
    parallel ridge family and stepped breaks; use walls and breaks to mark route
    commitment.
